<div class="page-top">
  <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="bc-sep">/</span><span class="bc-cur">FAQ &amp; Policies</span></nav>
  <div class="faq-header">
    <h1>FAQ &amp; Policies</h1>
    <p>Everything about ordering, shipping, returns, and warranties.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq-body">
    <div class="faq-section-label" id="shipping">Shipping</div>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">When will my order ship?</div><div class="faq-a">Orders process in <strong>1&ndash;3 business days</strong> and ship from California via USPS Priority or UPS Ground. Delivery typically takes about 7 business days. You'll get a tracking number the moment it leaves our warehouse.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">Is packaging discreet?</div><div class="faq-a">Always. Every order ships in a plain outer box with <strong>no logos, no product descriptions, and no indication of contents.</strong></div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">Do you ship internationally?</div><div class="faq-a">Currently we ship to all 50 US states. International shipping is not available at this time.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">How much is shipping?</div><div class="faq-a"><strong>Free shipping on all orders over $75.</strong> Standard shipping on orders under $75 is calculated at checkout based on your location.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-section-label" id="warranty">Returns &amp; Warranty</div>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">What's your return policy?</div><div class="faq-a">Returns accepted on <strong>unopened, unused items within 14 days</strong> of delivery. We can't accept used pieces for hygiene reasons. Return shipping is the customer's responsibility unless the item arrived damaged. Contact us with your order number to start a return.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">What does the 1-Year Guarantee cover?</div><div class="faq-a">Manufacturing defects, joint failures, and stress cracks under normal use. Doesn't cover drops. Email us with your order number and photos &mdash; <strong>we'll take care of you.</strong></div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">My item arrived damaged. What now?</div><div class="faq-a">Don't dispose of packaging. Photograph the box and the piece. Email us within 48 hours &mdash; <strong>we'll ship a replacement at no cost.</strong></div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">Can I exchange for a different product?</div><div class="faq-a">Yes, for unopened items in the 14-day return window. Reach out before returning so we can confirm availability.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-section-label">Products &amp; Ordering</div>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">What is borosilicate glass?</div><div class="faq-a">Laboratory-grade glass known for thermal resistance and durability. <strong>Significantly stronger than regular glass</strong> and handles temperature changes without cracking. Chemically inert &mdash; it doesn't react with heat or leach chemicals.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">Are your products for tobacco use only?</div><div class="faq-a">All FLOW3R products are sold as <strong>tobacco smoking accessories</strong> for legal use in accordance with your local and state laws. By purchasing, you confirm you are 21+.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">How do I clean my piece?</div><div class="faq-a">Rinse with warm water after every session. For a deep clean, use 91%+ isopropyl alcohol and coarse salt &mdash; shake, soak, rinse. Check our <a href="/pages/glass-guide" style="color:var(--gdk);font-weight:600">Glass Guide</a> for full instructions.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-card"><div class="faq-q">Do you have a rewards program?</div><div class="faq-a">Yes! Join free and earn 5 points per $1 spent. Redeem 100 points for $1 off any order. <a href="/pages/rewards" style="color:var(--gdk);font-weight:600">Learn more &rarr;</a></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-contact">
      <div class="faq-contact-head">
        <h3>Still have a question?</h3>
        <p>Our team is California-based and responds to every message personally &mdash; usually within 24 hours. No bots.</p>
      </div>
      {%- form 'contact', id: 'faqContactForm' -%}
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <div class="faq-form-success" id="faqSuccess">
            <div class="faq-form-success-h">Message sent.</div>
            <p class="faq-form-success-p">Thanks for reaching out &mdash; we'll get back to you within 24 hours, usually sooner. Check your inbox (and spam, just in case).</p>
          </div>
          <script>
            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){
              var s=document.getElementById('faqSuccess');
              if(s){s.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});}
            });
          </script>
        {%- else -%}
          {%- if form.errors -%}
            <div class="faq-form-errors">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[subject]" value="FAQ page — flow3r.shop">
          <div class="faq-form">
            <div class="faq-form-row">
              <div class="faq-form-field">
                <label for="faqName">Name</label>
                <input type="text" id="faqName" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" required>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-form-field">
                <label for="faqEmail">Email</label>
                <input type="email" id="faqEmail" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" required>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-form-field">
              <label for="faqOrder">Order number <span class="faq-form-opt">&mdash; optional, helps with returns &amp; warranty</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="faqOrder" name="contact[Order number]" placeholder="#1234">
            </div>
            <div class="faq-form-field">
              <label for="faqBody">Message</label>
              <textarea id="faqBody" name="contact[body]" placeholder="What can we help with?" required></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="faq-form-btn">Send Message</button>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .faq-contact{
    background:#245034;
    border-radius:14px;
    padding:40px 36px;
    margin-top:48px;
    color:#fff;
  }
  .faq-contact-head{ max-width:560px; margin-bottom:26px; }
  .faq-contact-head h3{
    font-size:24px;
    font-weight:600;
    color:#fff;
    margin-bottom:8px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  .faq-contact-head p{
    font-size:15px;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .faq-form{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px; }
  .faq-form-row{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:16px; }
  .faq-form-field{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:7px; }
  .faq-form-field label{
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);
  }
  .faq-form-opt{ color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:0; text-transform:none; }
  .faq-form-field input,
  .faq-form-field textarea{
    font-family:inherit;
    font-size:14px;
    color:#0d0d0d;
    background:#fff;
    border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:12px 14px;
    width:100%;
    transition:border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
  }
  .faq-form-field input::placeholder,
  .faq-form-field textarea::placeholder{ color:#b3b3b0; }
  .faq-form-field input:focus,
  .faq-form-field textarea:focus{
    outline:none;
    border-color:#fff;
    box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  }
  .faq-form-field textarea{ resize:vertical; min-height:130px; line-height:1.6; }
  .faq-form-btn{
    align-self:flex-start;
    background:#fff;
    color:#245034;
    border:none;
    border-radius:4px;
    font-family:inherit;
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.05em;
    padding:15px 32px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:opacity .2s, transform .15s;
  }
  .faq-form-btn:hover{ opacity:.9; transform:translateY(-1px); }
  .faq-form-success{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
    border-radius:6px;
    padding:26px 24px;
  }
  .faq-form-success-h{ font-size:18px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .faq-form-success-p{ font-size:14px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.8); line-height:1.6; }
  .faq-form-errors{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.95);
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:13px 16px;
    margin-bottom:4px;
  }
  .faq-form-errors ul{ margin:0; padding-left:18px; }
  .faq-form-errors li{ font-size:13px; color:#b23b3b; line-height:1.5; }
  @media (min-width:768px){
    .faq-form-row{ grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width:600px){
    .faq-contact{ padding:32px 22px; }
  }
</style>